# Search hygiene for ripgrep-based tools (rg, fd, Claude Code Grep/Glob, Codex).
# Not an access boundary: never bypass it with `rg -uu` to reach docs/plans/archive/.
# .gitignore already hides target/ and perf-runs/ where tools honour it; they are
# repeated here for tools run with --no-ignore-vcs.
docs/plans/archive/
target/
perf-runs/
flamegraph.svg
perf.data
perf.data.old
*.profraw
*.profdata
